#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The function B<clearerr>()  clears the end-of-file and error indicators for "
"the stream pointed to by I<stream>."
msgstr ""
"La función B<clearerr>() limpia los indicadores de fin-de-fichero y error "
"para el flujo indicado por I<flujo>."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The function B<feof>()  tests the end-of-file indicator for the stream "
"pointed to by I<stream>, returning nonzero if it is set.  The end-of-file "
"indicator can be cleared only by the function B<clearerr>()."
msgstr ""
"La función B<feof>() inspecciona el indicador de fin-de-fichero para el "
"flujo indicado por I<flujo>, devolviendo no cero si está puesto. El "
"indicador de fin-de-fichero sólo puede ser limpiado por la función "
"B<clearerr>()."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The function B<ferror>()  tests the error indicator for the stream pointed "
"to by I<stream>, returning nonzero if it is set.  The error indicator can be "
"reset only by the B<clearerr>()  function."
msgstr ""
"La función B<ferror>() inspecciona el indicador de error para el flujo "
"indicado por I<flujo>, devolviendo no cero si está puesto. El indicador de "
"error sólo puede ser puesto a cero por la función B<clearerr>()."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "For nonlocking counterparts, see B<unlocked_stdio>(3)."
msgstr "Para las versiones no-bloqueantes, véase B<unlocked_stdio>(3)."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "RETURN VALUE"
msgstr "VALOR DEVUELTO"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<feof>()  function returns nonzero if the end-of-file indicator is set "
"for I<stream>; otherwise, it returns zero."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<ferror>()  function returns nonzero if the error indicator is set for "
"I<stream>; otherwise, it returns zero."
msgstr ""

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
